        "content": "<p>Going to Christ</p><p>I go to Christ my Saviour With every little need The help He always gives me Is wonderful indeed</p><p>I go when I am mourning The loss of loved ones near He speaks words of comfort sweet, He does my spirit cheer</p><p>I go when I am fearing The cruse of oil will fail He sends me the needful means And thus does prayer prevent</p><p>Cecilia Havergal</p>",
